{"text_a": "The city council approved the new library plan last week. Construction will begin in the spring and is expected to take about two years. The building will include a public reading room, a children's section and a small cafe. Residents can submit comments on the design until the end of the month.", "text_b": "市议会上周批准了新图书馆的方案。工程将于春季动工，预计需要大约两年时间。该建筑将设有公共阅览室、儿童区和一间小咖啡馆。居民可以在本月底之前对设计提交意见。", "labels": "1-0 2-2 3-5 4-12 5-8 6-9 7-13 8-3 9-4 10-15 11-16 12-18 13-22 14-19 16-20 17-24 19-26 21-28 22-30 23-31 24-32 25-35 26-36 27-38 28-39 31-42 32-44 33-46 34-47 36-48 39-50 40-51 41-52 42-54 43-56 44-58 45-59 46-61 47-73 48-75 49-69 51-70 52-67 54-66 56-64 57-65 58-76", "units_a": ["The", "city", "council", "approved", "the", "new", "library", "plan", "last", "week", ".", "Construction", "will", "begin", "in", "the", "spring", "and", "is", "expected", "to", "take", "about", "two", "years", ".", "The", "building", "will", "include", "a", "public", "reading", "room", ",", "a", "children", "'", "s", "section", "and", "a", "small", "cafe", ".", "Residents", "can", "submit", "comments", "on", "the", "design", "until", "the", "end", "of", "the", "month", "."], "units_b": ["市", "议", "会", "上", "周", "批", "准", "了", "新", "图", "书", "馆", "的", "方", "案", "。", "工", "程", "将", "于", "春", "季", "动", "工", "，", "预", "计", "需", "要", "大", "约", "两", "年", "时", "间", "。", "该", "建", "筑", "将", "设", "有", "公", "共", "阅", "览", "室", "、", "儿", "童", "区", "和", "一", "间", "小", "咖", "啡", "馆", "。", "居", "民", "可", "以", "在", "本", "月", "底", "之", "前", "对", "设", "计", "提", "交", "意", "见", "。"]}
